<title>UK: Standard Chartered has no comment on ANZ.</title>
<headline>Standard Chartered has no comment on ANZ.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Chartered Plc on Monday declined to comment on rumours that it would merge with Australia and New Zealand Banking Group.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not comment on market rumours,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Banking analysts said it was highly unlikely that anything of substance lay behind the talk which surfaced in Australian newspapers over the weekend.</p>
<p>&quot;This is one that's come up before,&quot; said one analyst. &quot;It's just another of those pointless takeover rumours.&quot;</p>
<p>Standard Chartered shares were 10p higher at 686.5p. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
